    "title": "求每个内角",
    "body": "每个内角为\\(1080^{\\circ}\\div8=135^{\\circ}\\)。"
   }
  ],
  "check": "每个外角\\(360^{\\circ}\\div8=45^{\\circ}\\)，内角\\(180^{\\circ}-45^{\\circ}=135^{\\circ}\\)，结果一致。",
